# Branch names

Name every branch `<type>/<short-description>`. Use lowercase and hyphens. Do not use Linear's suggested `username/mik-85-long-title` names.

Types:

- `feat` — new behavior
- `fix` — a bug fix
- `docs` — documentation only
- `chore` — scaffolding, tooling, or config
- `test` — tests only
- `refactor` — restructure that preserves behavior

```text
chore/scaffold-plugin
feat/wire-obsidian-live
docs/install-readme
test/golden-questions
```

Create the branch yourself when starting an issue. Do not commit or push unless asked.
